Note: this licence covers the integration this repository adds: the waterbox/
driver, scripts and shims, except where a file says otherwise. Two files say
otherwise because they are made from DuckStation's own source and stay under
its terms (GPL-3.0): waterbox/host.cpp, which began as upstream's
src/duckstation-regtest/regtest_host.cpp, and waterbox/audio-stream.cpp, which
implements the class upstream's src/util/audio_stream.h declares. The patches/
directory modifies DuckStation and is offered under DuckStation's terms as
well.

Upstream is DuckStation at commit 14ab642ff3d5d489d388c8062530aa2f7c9a1372
(2024-09-01), the last commit of stenzek/duckstation whose every source file
is offered under the GPL-3.0: the commits after it relicensed the project
under CC BY-NC-ND 4.0, which does not allow a modified version to be
distributed, and nothing from them is here. docs/PLAN.md, "The pin", has the
evidence. The built core contains that DuckStation and the libraries it
bundles, and the package as a whole is therefore distributed under the
GPL-3.0; see waterbox/package-licenses.json.
